Kya [F]hua tera [C]wada,        Woh [F]kasam, woh [C]iraada
Bhoolega [C]dil jis din [F]tumhe,        Woh din [G]zindagi ka aakhri [F]din [C]hoga

[F]Teri [G]baahon mein [F]beeti har [C]shaam,        [F]Bewafa [G]yeh bhi kya [F]yaad [C]nahin

Kya [F]hua tera [C]waada,        Woh [F]kasam, woh [C]iraada
Bhoolega [C]dil jis din [F]tumhe,        Woh din [G]zindagi ka aakhri [F]din [C]hoga

Kya [F]hua tera [C]wada,        Woh [F]kasam, woh [C]iraada

Oh kehne [Am]waale mujhko [Am]farebi,        Kaun [F]farebi hai [G]ye [C]bata
